00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.070
On this episode, we'll look at
Cloud SQL, a managed service

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.850
that helps make the management
of MySQL and Postgres databases

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:24.559
far less painful.

00:00:24.559 --> 00:00:26.016
ANKUSH AGARWAL:
We'll be taking you

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:28.410
